  <h2 style="text-align: center;">
    While Participants Focus on the Crypto Market Carnage, The Stablecoin Economy Blasts Past $100 Billion in Value
  </h2>
  
  <ul>
    <li>
      A number of people on Twitter have been discussing the crypto market carnage. The popular crypto Twitter account Alex Krüger said: “This is how a bear market feels like. Sellers capitulating, spot positions getting liquidated, bitcoin futures curve moving towards backwardation. Be great if this were a ‘bottom signal,’” he added.
    </li>
    <li>
      The Twitter account that goes by the name “Light” shared a chart and said: Starting to lever up long here on BTC and ETH. 50% drawdowns are indicative of full capitulation, as is sentiment, with retail panic dumping into low liquidity on the weekend.”
    </li>
  </ul><figure id="attachment_461159" aria-describedby="caption-attachment-461159" style="width: 1200px" class="wp-caption aligncenter">
  
  <img decoding="async" loading="lazy" class="wp-image-461159 size-full" src="https://technologymanias.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/e2efyssx0aika_x.png" alt="" width="1200" height="689" srcset="https://technologymanias.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/e2efyssx0aika_x.png 1200w, https://news.bitcoin.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/e2efyssx0aika_x-300x172.png 300w, https://news.bitcoin.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/e2efyssx0aika_x-1024x588.png 1024w, https://news.bitcoin.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/e2efyssx0aika_x-768x441.png 768w, https://news.bitcoin.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/e2efyssx0aika_x-696x400.png 696w, https://news.bitcoin.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/e2efyssx0aika_x-1068x613.png 1068w, https://news.bitcoin.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/e2efyssx0aika_x-731x420.png 731w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /><figcaption id="caption-attachment-461159" class="wp-caption-text">The chart shared by the Twitter account and trader called “Light” on Sunday, May 23, 2021.</figcaption></figure> 
  
  <ul>
    <li>
      Meanwhile, while everyone has been looking at the crypto market’s ‘blood in the streets,’ the entire capitalization of fiat stablecoins has crossed the $100 billion mark. Tether (USDT) commands the largest valuation with $59 billion today and usd coin (USDC) holds a valuation of around $19.9 billion.
    </li>
  </ul>
  
  <p>
    <img decoding="async" loading="lazy" class="aligncenter wp-image-461162" src="https://technologymanias.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/100billion.jpg" alt="" width="571" height="214" srcset="https://technologymanias.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/100billion.jpg 800w, https://news.bitcoin.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/100billion-300x113.jpg 300w, https://news.bitcoin.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/100billion-768x288.jpg 768w, https://news.bitcoin.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/100billion-696x261.jpg 696w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 571px) 100vw, 571px" />
  </p>
  
  <ul>
    <li>
      The Director of Research at The Block Crypto, Larry Cermak, discussed how market players are using the stablecoin market. “One of the most bullish things about this cycle compared to the previous one is that people are not taking out as much cash but rather letting it sit in stablecoins but still in the ecosystem,” Cermak tweeted on Sunday. “The mentality now is that at the very least you can earn some yield and deploy later.”
    </li>
  </ul>
  
